\title{Agentic post-training setup}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{notes}
\tag{agent}

\p{An RLVR response can be a single token sequence. Agentic training adds an
environment that reacts between decisions. This section introduces that
interaction one object at a time, beginning with the task and ending with the
complete trajectory.}

